-- CAPABILITY ------------------ errors/cap_widen_4.march

`main` is granted `Cap(IO.Console)`, but the program reaches `IO.FileWrite` (reached from `main`: main → as_writer). The grant is a ceiling on the WHOLE program — declaring `needs IO.FileWrite` does not raise it. [cap_grant_exceeded]
help: add a `Cap(IO.FileWrite)` parameter to `main` (e.g. `fn main(…, _cap_filewrite : Cap(IO.FileWrite))`), or widen the whole grant to `Cap(IO)`, or remove the use.

